beast("foe-ghost", "a ghost", 5.8, "odd", "A ghost 5.8 ft tall: a pale cream-white hooded shroud figure with a hollow dark face showing two round eye holes and an open wailing mouth, two thick draped arms raised only a little in front of its chest with trailing sleeve ends hanging close. Below the waist the shroud narrows into ONE thick ragged column of cloth whose tattered hem rests flat at ground level (no legs, no feet). Solid and opaque like carved wax, pale cream with soft grey-green shadows; not transparent, not glowing.", "one pale hooded shroud-like ghost figure with a dark hollow face, its lower part a single column of cloth reaching the ground", ["one upright shroud figure"], prio=3, srd=["ghost", "specter", "poltergeist"], tags=["spirit", "spectre", "undead"])
beast("foe-wraith", "a wraith", 6.2, "odd", "A wraith, 6.2 ft tall: a towering figure of ragged CHARCOAL-BLACK robes with a deep empty hood (only two small pale ochre eyes inside), thick tattered sleeves, and two long pale bone-grey clawed hands reaching forward a little at chest height, close. Below the waist the robe narrows into ONE thick ragged column whose torn hem rests flat at ground level (no legs). A rusty iron crown sits on the hood. Solid and opaque; not transparent, not glowing.", "one tall black-robed hooded spectre with pale clawed hands, its lower part a single column of cloth reaching the ground", ["a dark hooded robe with no face"], srd=["wraith", "shadow", "specter"], tags=["spirit", "undead", "shadow"])
beast("foe-wight", "a wight", 6.0, "hum", "A wight, 6 ft tall: a gaunt dead warrior-king with tight grey-cream skin over the skull, long thin white hair in two solid hanks, burning pale eyes (solid ochre), in ancient dark bronze scale armour with a tattered burgundy cloak lying flat and close. Its RIGHT hand holds a broad ancient SWORD with a pale verdigris-cream blade upright in front of its shoulder; its LEFT arm holds a round dark bronze shield close in front of its side.", "one gaunt dead warrior in ancient scale armour holding one sword upright and one round shield", ["exactly one sword", "a corpse-like face"], srd=["wight"], tags=["barrow", "undead"], boss=True)
beast("foe-mummy", "a mummy", 6.0, "hum", "A mummy, 6 ft tall: a dried corpse wrapped from head to foot in broad cream-ochre linen bandages with a few loose thick ends hanging short, two dark eye hollows, a brass collar of big plates on its chest. Both arms raised a little, forearms forward at chest height close to the body, hands hanging like claws. No weapon.", "one bandage-wrapped mummy with its forearms raised a little", ["wrapped in bandages"], srd=["mummy", "mummy lord"], tags=["tomb", "undead"])
beast("foe-vampire-m", "a vampire lord", 6.2, "robe", "A vampire lord, 6.2 ft tall: a pale, gaunt nobleman with slicked-back black hair with a widow's peak, pointed ears, red eyes and two thick fangs. A black formal coat with brass buttons over a burgundy waistcoat, and a long black CAPE with a high stiff collar and burgundy lining hanging straight down his back to his ankles (flat, not flying). His RIGHT hand holds the edge of the cape across his chest; his left hand is raised, clawed, close beside his face.", "one pale nobleman in a long black cape with a high collar", ["a long cape"], srd=["vampire", "vampire spawn"], tags=["undead", "count", "boss"], boss=True)
beast("foe-vampire-f", "a vampire lady", 5.8, "robe", "A vampire lady, 5.8 ft tall: a pale, beautiful, cruel noblewoman with long black hair in one thick solid fall, pointed ears, red eyes and two thick fangs. A long burgundy gown with a black bodice ending at the ankles, and a high stiff black collar rising behind her head. Her RIGHT hand holds a big brass GOBLET up at chest height; her left hand is raised, clawed, close beside her face.", "one pale fanged noblewoman in a long gown with a high collar holding one goblet", ["one goblet", "a long gown"], srd=["vampire", "vampire spawn"], tags=["undead", "countess", "boss"], boss=True)
beast("foe-lich", "a lich", 6.0, "robe", "A lich, 6 ft tall: a skeletal undead sorcerer-king with a bare grinning skull with two pale green eye-lights (solid), in a rich but rotting long burgundy robe with tarnished brass embroidery ending at the ankles, a tall jagged brass CROWN, a brass amulet box on a chain on its chest. Its RIGHT hand holds a STAFF upright close beside it, foot at ground level: a THICK dark iron staff topped with a pale skull holding a big green crystal block, level with its crown. Its left bony hand is raised, open, close.", "one crowned skeleton sorcerer in a rich rotting robe holding one thick skull-topped staff upright", ["exactly one staff, complete end to end", "a crown", "a skull face"], shaft="staff", top=6.6, srd=["lich"], tags=["undead", "necromancer", "archmage", "boss"], boss=True)
beast("foe-banshee", "a banshee", 5.6, "odd", "A banshee, 5.6 ft tall: the wailing spirit of a dead elf woman, with a gaunt screaming face (mouth wide open, dark hollow eyes), long white hair streaming UP and back as one thick solid flame-like shape, pointed ears, thin arms raised with clawed hands close beside her face, in a ragged pale grey-green burial gown that narrows below the waist into ONE thick tattered column whose hem rests flat at ground level (no legs). Solid and opaque; not transparent, not glowing.", "one screaming ghost-woman with streaming white hair, her lower part a single column of ragged cloth", ["a screaming face", "streaming hair"], srd=["banshee", "ghost"], tags=["spirit", "undead", "wailing"])
beast("foe-death-knight", "a death knight", 6.6, "hum", "A death knight, 6.6 ft tall: an undead champion in a full suit of black plate armour with burgundy trim and thick blunt spikes on the shoulders, a great helmet with a dark eye slit showing two red eye-lights (solid) and two thick curved horns, a ragged burgundy cape hanging straight down the back. BOTH gauntlets rest on the pommel of a huge GREATSWORD standing point-down at ground level in front of it, pale steel blade with a burgundy edge.", "one knight in black spiked plate armour and a horned great helm, both hands on one huge sword standing point-down", ["one greatsword standing point-down", "black plate armour and a horned helmet"], shaft="sword", srd=["death knight", "knight", "blackguard"], tags=["dark knight", "black knight", "antipaladin", "boss", "undead"], boss=True, prio=3)
# -- giants and beast-folk
beast("foe-ogre", "an ogre", 9.0, "hum", "An ogre, 9 ft tall: a huge, fat, dim-looking giant with a small bald head, tiny eyes, a big lower jaw with two blunt tusks, a huge belly, thick short legs and enormous hands; dull ochre-tan skin. A patched hide kilt, a broad rope belt with a big cream skull as a buckle, hide wraps on its shins. Its RIGHT hand holds a huge CLUB upright beside its shoulder: a pale bone-white tree trunk as thick as its forearm with thick iron bands. Its left hand is a fist near its hip.", "one huge fat giant with a small bald head holding one enormous club upright at the shoulder", ["exactly one huge club"], base=10, group="large", prio=3, srd=["ogre", "half-ogre"], tags=["giant", "brute"])
beast("foe-ogre-chief", "an ogre chieftain", 9.5, "hum", "An ogre chieftain, 9.5 ft tall: a huge, fat giant with a small head, a topknot, a big lower jaw with two blunt tusks, dull grey-tan skin. Crude dark iron plates strapped over one shoulder and its belly, a necklace of big cream skulls, a fur kilt. BOTH hands hold a huge two-handed MAUL upright in front of it, butt at ground level between its feet: a pale trunk shaft and a big square grey stone block head level with its chest.", "one huge fat armoured giant with a skull necklace holding one enormous stone hammer upright in front of it", ["exactly one huge hammer, complete end to end"], shaft="maul", base=10, group="large", srd=["ogre", "ogre zombie", "oni"], tags=["giant", "boss", "ogre mage"], boss=True)
beast("foe-troll", "a troll", 9.0, "hum", "A troll, 9 ft tall: a tall, gaunt, rubbery giant with moss-green warty skin, a very long hooked nose, a wide mouth of thick crooked fangs, a mop of thick dark ropey hair, long thick arms reaching to its knees, big clawed hands and big three-toed feet; stooped. A ragged ochre hide loincloth. No weapon: both long arms hang forward close to its body, claws at knee height.", "one tall gaunt green long-nosed long-armed troll standing stooped, unarmed", ["long arms and a long nose"], base=10, group="large", prio=3, srd=["troll"], tags=["giant", "regenerating"])
beast("foe-hill-giant", "a hill giant", 15.0, "hum", "A hill giant, 15 ft tall: an enormous, lumpish, pot-bellied brute with a low sloping forehead, a tangle of brown hair, a stubbly jaw, ruddy tan skin, short thick bowed legs. A crude tunic of stitched hides over one shoulder, a rope belt hung with a whole dead sheep. Its RIGHT hand holds a huge CLUB upright beside its shoulder: an uprooted pale tree trunk with thick root stubs at the top. Everything inside an 8.5-ft-wide cylinder.", "one enormous pot-bellied giant in hides holding one tree-trunk club upright at the shoulder", ["exactly one tree-trunk club"], base=10, group="large", srd=["hill giant", "stone giant", "frost giant", "fire giant"], tags=["giant"], boss=True)
beast("foe-cyclops", "a cyclops", 13.0, "hum", "A cyclops, 13 ft tall: a massive, muscular one-eyed giant with ONE huge eye in the middle of its forehead under a single heavy brow, a bald head, a wide mouth with thick blunt teeth, grey-tan skin. A hide kilt and a broad leather strap across its chest. Its RIGHT hand holds a huge spiked CLUB upright beside its shoulder, a pale trunk with thick blunt iron spikes. Its left hand is a fist near its hip. Everything inside an 8.5-ft-wide cylinder.", "one massive giant with a single eye in its forehead holding one big spiked club upright", ["ONE eye in the middle of the forehead"], base=10, group="large", srd=["cyclops"], tags=["giant", "one-eyed"], boss=True)
beast("foe-ettin", "an ettin", 13.0, "hum", "An ettin, 13 ft tall: a huge filthy giant with TWO heads side by side on its broad shoulders, each bald with a jutting tusked jaw, the two faces scowling at each other; grey-brown skin, a patched hide tunic. Each hand holds a big spiked CLUB upright beside its shoulders, close: thick pale shafts with spiked iron ball heads. Everything inside an 8.5-ft-wide cylinder.", "one huge giant with two heads holding two spiked clubs upright", ["TWO heads"], base=10, group="large", srd=["ettin"], tags=["giant", "two-headed"])
beast("foe-minotaur", "a minotaur", 8.0, "hum", "A minotaur, 8 ft tall: a huge muscular man's body with the shaggy dark brown HEAD OF A BULL: a broad muzzle with a brass nose ring, two thick, short, forward-curving cream horns, small ears. Brown fur on the head, shoulders and from the waist down, legs ending in big cloven hooves, a leather kilt with brass studs and one iron shoulder plate. BOTH hands hold a huge double-bladed AXE upright in front of it, butt at ground level between its hooves: a thick pale shaft and two big bright crescent blades beside its horns.", "one huge bull-headed man with horns holding one big double axe upright in front of it", ["a bull's head with horns", "exactly one big axe, complete end to end"], shaft="axe", base=10, group="large", prio=3, srd=["minotaur"], tags=["bull", "labyrinth"], boss=True)
beast("foe-centaur", "a centaur", 7.5, "quad", "A centaur, 7.5 ft tall to the top of the head: the body of a sturdy chestnut horse with, in place of the horse's neck and head, the upright torso, arms and head of a tanned, bearded man with long dark hair in one thick tail. A broad leather harness across his chest. All four horse legs thick and sturdy with big hooves flat on the ground; a thick dark horse tail hanging straight down close behind. His RIGHT hand holds a SPEAR upright close beside his shoulder, butt at ground level by the front hoof: a THICK bone-white shaft with a BIG broad bright leaf blade above his head.", "one centaur: a horse's four-legged body with a man's upper body, holding one spear upright", ["a horse body with a human torso", "exactly one spear, complete end to end"], shaft="spear", base=10, group="large", length=7.0, top=7.5, srd=["centaur"], tags=["horse-man", "fey"])
beast("foe-harpy", "a harpy", 5.5, "hum", "A harpy, 5.5 ft tall: a woman's gaunt head and torso with wild dark hair as one solid clump and a snarling fanged face, on the legs of a huge bird: thick scaly ochre legs with big talons flat on the ground. Instead of arms she has two big feathered WINGS FOLDED tight against her sides and back as two thick solid dark grey-brown shapes (not spread), a fan of thick short tail feathers touching the ground behind. Ragged cream cloth round the chest.", "one bird-woman with folded wings and big taloned bird legs", ["wings folded, not spread", "bird legs with talons"], srd=["harpy"], tags=["bird-woman", "siren"])
beast("foe-satyr", "a satyr", 5.5, "hum", "A satyr, 5.5 ft tall: a grinning, bearded man with two short thick curled ram horns and pointed ears, a bare tanned chest, and the shaggy brown-furred LEGS OF A GOAT ending in cloven hooves, a short tufted tail. A wreath of big ochre vine leaves on his head. Both hands hold a set of thick pale PAN PIPES (five fat tubes bound in a row) to his lips, close.", "one horned goat-legged man playing pan pipes", ["goat legs with hooves", "horns", "pan pipes"], srd=["satyr"], tags=["faun", "fey", "piper"])
beast("foe-dryad", "a dryad", 5.6, "robe", "A dryad, 5.6 ft tall: a slender woman-shaped tree spirit with smooth honey-brown bark for skin, hair made of FIVE big solid chunky moss-green leaf clumps, pointed ears, and a gown of big overlapping ochre and green leaves that ends at the ankles in a ring of thick short roots flat on the ground. Her RIGHT hand holds a thick pale flowering BRANCH upright beside her shoulder with three big cream blossoms; her left hand is open at her side, close.", "one bark-skinned woman with leaf-clump hair and a gown of leaves, holding one flowering branch", ["bark skin or leaf hair", "a gown of leaves"], srd=["dryad"], tags=["fey", "nymph", "tree spirit"])
beast("foe-hag", "a hag", 5.4, "robe", "A green hag, 5.4 ft tall: a hideous, hunched old crone with warty moss-green skin, a huge hooked nose, a jutting chin with one thick tooth, long stringy grey hair as two solid hanks, and long thick iron-black claws. A ragged charcoal dress and a shawl of dark moss ending at the ankles, a necklace of big cream bones. Her RIGHT hand holds a thick gnarled bone-white STICK upright close beside her, tip at ground level; her left claw is raised close beside her face.", "one hunched green-skinned old witch with a hooked nose and claws, leaning on one thick stick", ["green skin and a hooked nose", "exactly one stick, complete end to end"], shaft="stick", srd=["green hag", "sea hag", "night hag"], tags=["witch", "crone", "fey", "boss"], boss=True)
beast("foe-werewolf", "a werewolf", 6.8, "hum", "A werewolf in its hybrid form, 6.8 ft tall: a hulking wolf-headed man covered in shaggy charcoal-grey fur, a long snarling wolf muzzle with thick fangs, pointed ears, a heavy mane-less neck, long arms with big clawed hands held up close in front of its chest, digitigrade legs with clawed feet, a bushy tail hanging down close behind. The torn remains of a cream shirt and burgundy trousers hang in thick rags.", "one upright wolf-headed furred man with claws raised close, in torn clothes", ["a wolf's head on an upright body"], srd=["werewolf", "lycanthrope"], tags=["lycanthrope", "wolfman"], boss=True)
beast("foe-wererat", "a wererat", 5.2, "hum", "A wererat in its hybrid form, 5.2 ft tall: a hunched rat-headed man with greasy brown fur, a long pointed snout with two big cream front teeth, round ears, beady eyes, a long THICK bare pink tail curling round its feet on the ground. A patched dark burgundy leather coat and hood (down). Its RIGHT hand holds a broad short SWORD upright in front of its shoulder, bright blade; its LEFT hand holds a pale hand crossbow (a short thick stock) against its chest.", "one hunched rat-headed man in a leather coat holding one short sword upright", ["a rat's head on an upright body", "a thick bare tail"], srd=["wererat"], tags=["lycanthrope", "ratman", "thieves' guild"])
# -- fiends and elementals
beast("foe-imp", "an imp", 2.2, "hum", "An imp drawn large for the table, 2.2 ft tall: a tiny brick-red devil with a big grinning head, two short thick horns, pointed ears, a pot belly, two small bat WINGS FOLDED against its back as two thick solid shapes, and a long THICK tail ending in a big barbed sting curled forward close beside its feet on the ground. Standing on two clawed feet, both little clawed hands rubbing together in front of its chest.", "one tiny red horned devil with folded wings and a thick stinger tail", ["small folded wings", "horns", "a tail with a sting"], srd=["imp", "quasit"], tags=["devil", "familiar", "fiend"])
beast("foe-demon", "a lesser demon", 7.5, "hum", "A lesser demon, 7.5 ft tall: a hulking brute with dark burgundy-red skin, a wide fanged underbite, two big thick horns curving forward like a bull's, small yellow eyes, a mane of black bristles as one chunky ridge, massive shoulders and long arms with huge clawed hands held up close in front of its chest, legs ending in big cloven hooves, a thick short tail. An iron collar and broken chains in thick short links at its wrists. No wings.", "one hulking red horned demon with claws raised close and hooves", ["horns", "hooves", "red skin"], base=10, group="large", srd=["barlgura", "hezrou", "dretch", "bearded devil", "barbed devil"], tags=["fiend", "devil", "demon", "boss"], boss=True)
beast("foe-dretch", "a dretch", 3.8, "hum", "A dretch, 3.8 ft tall: a squat, bloated, wretched little demon with pale grey-green blubbery skin, a wide drooling slack mouth with small fangs, sagging ears, tiny eyes, a pot belly, long arms dragging thick-clawed hands near the ground at its sides, short bowed legs with big flat feet.", "one squat bloated grey-green little demon with long arms and a slack mouth", ["a bloated body with long arms"], srd=["dretch", "lemure", "manes"], tags=["fiend", "demon", "minion"])
beast("foe-hellhound", "a hell hound", 4.0, "quad", "A hell hound, 4 ft tall to the ears and about 4.5 ft long: a heavy, mastiff-like hound with charcoal-black hide, glowing ember-orange cracks painted along its ribs and legs (painted, not glowing), a short blunt muzzle with thick fangs and a tongue of solid orange flame shape lolling out, small pointed ears laid back, a spiked iron collar, a thick tail carried low. Not a wolf: short smooth hide, no fur tufts.", "one black hound with orange cracks and a spiked collar standing on all four legs", QUAD + ["a spiked collar or fiery markings"], length=4.5, srd=["hell hound"], tags=["fiend", "fire", "dog"])
beast("foe-succubus", "a succubus", 5.8, "hum", "A succubus, 5.8 ft tall: a beautiful, dangerous fiend in the shape of a woman with deep burgundy-red skin, two small thick horns curving back from her brow, long black hair as one solid fall, pointed ears, and two bat WINGS FOLDED tight behind her as two thick solid dark shapes framing her shoulders (not spread). A modest close-fitting black and brass tunic-dress to the knee and tall boots. A thick tail with a spade tip hangs close behind her legs. One hand on her hip, the other raised, palm up, close beside her shoulder.", "one red-skinned horned woman with folded bat wings and a spade-tipped tail", ["folded wings", "horns"], srd=["succubus/incubus"], tags=["fiend", "incubus", "devil", "temptress"], boss=True)
ELE = "Solid and opaque like carved wax or clay; not transparent, not glowing; one fused mass with its underside flat on the ground; everything inside an 8.5-ft-wide cylinder."
beast("foe-fire-elemental", "a fire elemental", 8.0, "odd", "A fire elemental, 8 ft tall: a towering living FLAME in the rough shape of a hunched giant: a broad base of thick flame-tongues flat on the ground, a body of big chunky upward-curling flame shapes, two thick flame arms held close, and a head-like peak with two dark ember eyes. Bright orange and yellow with deep red at the base. " + ELE, "one giant figure made of chunky solid flames", ["made of flames"], base=10, group="large", srd=["fire elemental", "magmin"], tags=["elemental", "flame"])
beast("foe-water-elemental", "a water elemental", 8.0, "odd", "A water elemental, 8 ft tall: a towering WAVE in the rough shape of a hunched giant: a broad swirling base flat on the ground, a body of big chunky curling wave shapes with thick cream foam crests, two heavy water arms held close, and a head-like crest with two dark hollow eyes. Deep grey-GREEN sea water (green, not blue) with cream foam. " + ELE, "one giant figure made of chunky solid green waves with foam", ["made of water or waves"], base=10, group="large", srd=["water elemental", "water weird"], tags=["elemental", "wave"])
beast("foe-earth-elemental", "an earth elemental", 8.0, "hum", "An earth elemental, 8 ft tall: a hulking, vaguely man-shaped heap of grey-brown boulders and packed ochre earth, with a small boulder head with two dark eye pits, huge shoulders, enormous rock fists hanging at knee height close to its sides, two thick stumpy rock legs. A few crystals of pale cream quartz and tufts of moss on its back. Solid, chunky, opaque.", "one hulking man-shaped heap of boulders with huge rock fists", ["made of rocks and earth"], base=10, group="large", srd=["earth elemental", "galeb duhr", "xorn"], tags=["elemental", "rock"])
beast("foe-air-elemental", "an air elemental", 8.0, "odd", "An air elemental, 8 ft tall: a living WHIRLWIND: a solid, tapering funnel of pale cream-grey cloud bands spiralling up from a narrow foot flat on the ground to a broad billowing top, with two thick swirling cloud arms held close and two dark eye hollows near the top; a few big leaves and stones caught in its surface. " + ELE, "one giant spiralling whirlwind of solid cloud bands with two eye hollows", ["a spiralling funnel shape"], base=10, group="large", srd=["air elemental", "invisible stalker", "dust mephit"], tags=["elemental", "whirlwind", "tornado"])
# -- monsters of legend
beast("foe-owlbear", "an owlbear", 8.0, "hum", "An owlbear, 8 ft tall: a monster with the massive furry body of a bear and the head of a giant owl, standing upright on its two thick hind legs. A big round owl head with a thick hooked ochre beak, huge round yellow eyes in cream facial discs and two short feather tufts; a ruff of broad chunky cream-and-brown feathers on the shoulders and chest blending into shaggy chestnut-brown bear fur on the belly and legs; thick arms with big dark claws held up in front of its chest, close to the body; big clawed feet. No wings.", "one upright monster with a bear's body and an owl's head and beak, claws raised close to its chest", ["an owl-like head with a beak on a bear-like body"], base=10, group="large", prio=3, srd=["owlbear"], tags=["bear", "owl"])
beast("foe-basilisk", "a basilisk", 3.0, "odd", "A basilisk, 3 ft tall at the back: a heavy EIGHT-legged lizard with a broad toad-like head, a wide mouth, two big pale staring eyes, a crest of thick short blunt spines down its back, a thick tail curved round beside its body so it fits a 4.5-ft circle. Dark moss-green and ochre mottled scales, cream belly. Eight short, very thick legs, all separately visible, all feet flat on the ground.", "one heavy eight-legged lizard with a spiny back and big pale eyes", ["a lizard with more than four legs"], srd=["basilisk"], tags=["lizard", "petrify"])
beast("foe-cockatrice", "a cockatrice", 2.5, "odd", "A cockatrice drawn large for the table, 2.5 ft tall: a monstrous ROOSTER with a lizard's tail: a big red comb and wattles, a hooked ochre beak, fierce yellow eyes, a cream and ochre feathered breast, two small leathery bat WINGS FOLDED against its sides as thick solid shapes, two thick scaly legs with big claws flat on the ground, and a long thick moss-green scaly tail curled forward along the ground beside it.", "one rooster-like monster with folded leathery wings and a thick scaly tail", ["a rooster's head and comb", "a scaly tail"], srd=["cockatrice"], tags=["chicken", "petrify"])
beast("foe-griffon", "a griffon", 7.0, "quad", "A griffon, 7 ft tall to the top of its head: the head, chest and front legs of a giant EAGLE (a white-cream feathered head with a big hooked ochre beak and fierce eyes, front legs with big ochre talons) and the body, hind legs and tufted tail of a LION (tawny golden fur), sitting-tall stance on all four legs. Its two great WINGS are FOLDED tight along its back as two thick solid chestnut-brown shapes (not spread). Tail curled close along its flank.", "one griffon: an eagle's head and talons on a lion's body, wings folded", ["an eagle head with a beak", "a lion's hindquarters", "wings folded, not spread"], base=10, group="large", length=7.5, srd=["griffon"], tags=["eagle-lion", "gryphon", "mount"])
beast("foe-hippogriff", "a hippogriff", 7.0, "quad", "A hippogriff, 7 ft tall to the top of its head: the head, chest, front legs and wings of a giant EAGLE (a grey-cream feathered head with a big hooked ochre beak, front legs with big talons) and the body, hind legs and tail of a dun HORSE with hooves. Its two great WINGS are FOLDED tight along its back as two thick solid shapes (not spread). A thick horse tail hanging straight down close behind. Standing square on all four legs.", "one hippogriff: an eagle's head and talons on a horse's body, wings folded", ["an eagle head with a beak", "a horse's hindquarters with hooves", "wings folded, not spread"], base=10, group="large", length=7.5, srd=["hippogriff", "pegasus"], tags=["eagle-horse", "mount"])
beast("foe-manticore", "a manticore", 6.0, "quad", "A manticore, 6 ft tall to the top of its head: the tawny-red body of a huge LION with a thick dark mane as one chunky mass, a leering, bearded, almost HUMAN face with a wide mouth of thick fangs, two leathery bat WINGS FOLDED tight along its back as two thick solid shapes (not spread), and a thick segmented tail arching up and forward over its back, ending in a big club of thick blunt cream SPIKES. Standing square on four thick legs.", "one lion-bodied monster with a human-like face, folded bat wings and a spiked tail arched over its back", ["a human-like face on a lion body", "a spiked tail", "wings folded, not spread"], base=10, group="large", length=7.0, srd=["manticore"], tags=["lion", "spikes"])
beast("foe-chimera", "a chimera", 7.0, "quad", "A chimera, 7 ft tall: one monster with THREE heads on the tawny body of a huge lion: a maned LION head in the middle, a horned black GOAT head rising beside it on the left shoulder, and a brick-red DRAGON head on a thick short neck on the right shoulder; goat hind legs with hooves, lion front paws, two leathery dragon WINGS FOLDED tight along its back as thick solid shapes (not spread), and a thick scaly tail curled close along its flank. Standing square on four thick legs.", "one three-headed monster (a lion head, a goat head and a dragon head) on a lion's body with folded wings", ["three different heads", "wings folded, not spread"], base=10, group="large", length=7.5, srd=["chimera"], tags=["three-headed"], boss=True)
beast("foe-hydra", "a hydra", 9.0, "odd", "A hydra, 9 ft tall: a heavy four-legged swamp reptile with a fat moss-green scaly body and FIVE thick serpent necks rising close together from its shoulders, each as thick as a man's waist and ending in a blunt snake-dragon head with a closed fanged mouth and ochre eyes, the five heads fanned a little at different heights but all inside an 8.5-ft-wide cylinder. Cream belly plates, four short thick legs flat on the ground, a thick tail curled close beside it.", "one fat four-legged reptile with five thick snake-headed necks", ["several (about five) heads on long thick necks"], base=10, group="large", srd=["hydra"], tags=["many-headed", "swamp"], boss=True)
beast("foe-wyvern", "a wyvern", 8.0, "odd", "A wyvern, 8 ft tall: a two-legged dragon-kin standing upright on two thick clawed hind legs, with no front legs: its arms are its WINGS, FOLDED tight against its sides as two thick solid dark leathery shapes with the wing-claws resting near the ground (not spread). A long neck held up, a narrow horned head with a closed fanged mouth, dull grey-brown and ochre scales with a cream belly, and a long thick tail curled forward close along the ground ending in a big dark barbed STING beside its feet.", "one two-legged dragon-like creature with folded wings for arms and a barbed sting on its tail", ["only two legs", "wings folded, not spread", "a sting on the tail"], base=10, group="large", srd=["wyvern"], tags=["dragon", "drake", "mount"])
beast("foe-giant-eagle", "a giant eagle", 6.0, "odd", "A giant eagle standing on the ground, 6 ft tall, its WINGS FOLDED tight against its body as two thick solid chestnut-brown shapes (not spread): a white-cream feathered head with a big hooked ochre beak and fierce yellow eyes, a broad brown-barred cream chest, two very thick ochre legs with big dark talons flat on the ground, a short thick banded tail touching the ground behind.", "one huge eagle standing upright on the ground with its wings folded", ["wings folded, not spread", "a hooked beak"], base=10, group="large", srd=["giant eagle", "roc", "giant vulture", "giant owl"], tags=["bird", "mount"])
beast("foe-sea-serpent", "a sea serpent", 9.0, "odd", "The head and neck of a sea serpent rising from the water, 9 ft tall, for water scenes: a thick, S-curved, scaly moss-green neck as thick as a barrel rising straight up from a low ring of chunky solid cream FOAM flat on the ground (the water's surface), with a finned crest of thick short blunt spines down its back, a long dragon-like head with a closed fanged mouth, two short whisker-barbels and ochre eyes, a cream throat. Only the neck and head show; everything inside an 8.5-ft-wide cylinder.", "one giant serpent's neck and head rising from a ring of foam", ["a long neck rising from a ring of foam or water"], base=10, group="large", srd=["giant constrictor snake", "plesiosaurus", "sea serpent", "dragon turtle"], tags=["water", "serpent", "sea monster"], boss=True)
beast("foe-tentacle", "a giant tentacle", 8.0, "odd", "ONE giant squid TENTACLE rising from the water, 8 ft tall, for water scenes: a very thick, tapering, S-curved arm as thick as a barrel at the bottom, dark burgundy on the outside with a cream underside covered in two rows of big round pale SUCKERS, its blunt tip curled over at the top; it rises straight up from a low ring of chunky solid cream FOAM flat on the ground (the water's surface).", "one giant tentacle with suckers rising from a ring of foam", ["suckers along the tentacle"], srd=["giant octopus", "kraken"], tags=["water", "kraken", "squid", "sea monster"])
beast("foe-dragon-wyrmling", "a dragon wyrmling", 3.5, "quad", "A dragon wyrmling, a baby dragon the size of a big dog: 3.5 ft tall to the tips of its horns, standing on four thick legs with clawed feet flat on the ground. A big head for its body with two short thick horns, a short snout, closed jaws and big ochre eyes; brick-RED scales with a cream plated belly; two small WINGS FOLDED tight against its back as two thick solid shapes (not spread); a thick tail curled forward close along its side on the ground.", "one small red dragon on four legs with folded wings", ["wings folded, not spread", "horns"], length=4.0, srd=["red dragon wyrmling", "gold dragon wyrmling", "brass dragon wyrmling", "pseudodragon", "black dragon wyrmling", "blue dragon wyrmling", "green dragon wyrmling", "white dragon wyrmling", "copper dragon wyrmling", "bronze dragon wyrmling", "silver dragon wyrmling"], tags=["dragon", "baby dragon", "drake"])
DRAGON = "A young dragon sitting upright on its haunches like a cat, 7 ft tall to the tips of its horns: a thick body with a {belly} plated belly, {scales} scales, a strong neck held up, a wedge-shaped head with {horns}, a short snout and closed jaws; two thick front legs planted straight down in front, big hind legs folded at its sides, all four clawed feet flat on the same level. Its two WINGS are FOLDED tight against its back and sides as two thick solid shapes (not spread, no thin membranes sticking out). Its thick tail curls forward along the ground close round its feet. The whole dragon fits inside an upright cylinder 8.5 ft across."
for col, scales, belly, horns, srd in (("red", "brick-red", "cream", "two thick back-swept horns", ["young red dragon", "young gold dragon", "young brass dragon"]),
                                      ("green", "deep moss-green", "ochre", "a tall nose horn and a fin-like crest of thick blunt spines down the neck", ["young green dragon", "young bronze dragon"]),
                                      ("black", "charcoal-black", "dark burgundy", "two thick horns that curve forward beside its jaws", ["young black dragon", "young copper dragon"]),
                                      ("white", "bone-white", "pale cream", "a broad flat crest and a short thick beak-like snout", ["young white dragon", "young silver dragon"])):
    beast(f"foe-dragon-young-{col}", f"a young {col} dragon", 7.0, "odd", DRAGON.format(scales=scales, belly=belly, horns=horns), f"one {col} dragon sitting upright with its wings folded against its body and its tail curled round its feet", ["wings folded, not spread", "a tail curled close"], base=10, group="large", prio=3 if col == "red" else 5.5, srd=srd, tags=["dragon", f"{col} dragon", "boss"], boss=True)

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ beasts and mounts (18)
g = "beast"
def animal(id, name, h, kind, design, desc, must=(), base=5, length=None, srd=None, tags=(), prio=5.2): beast(f"beast-{id}", name, h, kind, design, desc, must, base=base, group="beast", length=length, srd=srd, tags=tags, prio=prio)
animal("bear", "a brown bear", 4.5, "quad", "A big brown bear on all fours: 4.5 ft tall at the shoulder hump, about 7.5 ft long. Unmistakably a bear and not a dog, boar or lion: a massive rounded body, a high shoulder hump, a broad head with a short pale muzzle and small round ears, very thick legs with big clawed paws, a tiny stub tail. Warm chestnut-brown fur in a few big chunky tufts, cream muzzle. Mouth closed.", "one bear standing on all four legs", [], base=10, length=7.5, srd=["brown bear", "black bear", "polar bear", "cave bear"], tags=["bear"], prio=3)
animal("horse", "a saddled riding horse, no rider", 6.3, "quad", "A sturdy riding horse with NO rider: 5.2 ft tall at the withers, 6.3 ft to the top of its ears with the head held up, about 7.5 ft long. A chestnut coat, a cream blaze on the face, a thick cream mane drawn as one solid chunky crest lying on the neck, a thick cream tail hanging straight down close behind the hind legs as one solid mass. A honey-brown leather saddle with a burgundy saddle blanket and a simple bridle with short reins lying on the neck (no loose straps). Very thick sturdy legs with big hooves.", "one saddled horse with no rider standing on all four legs", ["a saddle on its back", "no rider"], base=10, length=7.5, srd=["riding horse", "draft horse"], tags=["horse", "mount"])
animal("warhorse", "a barded warhorse, no rider", 6.6, "quad", "A heavy WARHORSE in armour with NO rider: 5.5 ft tall at the withers, 6.6 ft to the top of its ears, about 7.5 ft long. A charcoal-grey coat, a steel face-plate (chamfron) with a short blunt spike, a segmented steel neck guard, and a long burgundy cloth caparison with a cream border hanging close over its body to the knees, a high war saddle. A thick dark tail hanging straight down close behind. Very thick legs with big feathered hooves.", "one armoured warhorse with a cloth cover and a saddle, no rider, standing on all four legs", ["armour or a cloth cover on the horse", "no rider"], base=10, length=7.5, srd=["warhorse", "warhorse skeleton", "nightmare"], tags=["horse", "mount", "destrier", "barded"])
animal("pony", "a pack pony", 4.6, "quad", "A shaggy pack pony with NO rider: 3.8 ft tall at the withers, 4.6 ft to the top of its ears, a short barrel body about 4.3 ft long. A cream-and-ochre dun coat, a thick dark mane as one solid chunky crest, a thick dark tail hanging straight down close behind. Two fat cream canvas PACK BAGS strapped tight against its sides and a rolled burgundy blanket on top. Short, very thick legs.", "one small pack pony carrying bags standing on all four legs", ["packs or bags on its back", "no rider"], length=4.3, srd=["pony"], tags=["horse", "mount", "pack animal"])
animal("mule", "a mule", 5.6, "quad", "A mule with NO rider and no load: 4.6 ft tall at the withers, 5.6 ft to the tips of its very LONG upright ears, a compact body about 4.5 ft long. Unmistakably a mule, not a horse: long ears, a big plain head with a pale cream muzzle, a short upright stubby mane, a thin tail with a tuft hanging straight down close behind. Dark grey-brown coat with a cream belly. A simple rope halter. Thick sturdy legs with small hooves.", "one mule with long ears standing on all four legs", ["long ears", "no rider"], length=4.5, srd=["mule"], tags=["donkey", "pack animal"])
animal("ox", "an ox", 5.0, "quad", "A draft ox: 5 ft tall at its heavy shoulders, a massive body about 7 ft long. Unmistakably an ox and not a bull-monster or a horse: a broad head carried low with two thick, short, outward-curving cream horns, a big wet nose, a heavy dewlap, a honey-brown and cream coat, a wooden YOKE of pale wood on its neck, a thin tail with a tuft hanging straight down. Thick legs with cloven hooves.", "one ox with horns and a yoke standing on all four legs", ["two horns"], base=10, length=7.0, srd=["ox", "cow"], tags=["cattle", "bull", "draft animal"])
animal("cow", "a cow", 4.4, "quad", "A dairy cow: 4.4 ft tall at the back, a deep barrel body about 4.6 ft long (compact, to fit a 5-ft square). Unmistakably a cow: a gentle broad face, two short thick horns, a cream coat with big burgundy-brown patches, a pink muzzle and udder, a brass BELL on a broad leather collar, a thin tail with a tuft hanging straight down. Thick legs with cloven hooves.", "one patched cow with a bell standing on all four legs", ["a cow with patches"], length=4.6, srd=["cow"], tags=["cattle", "livestock"])
animal("pig", "a pig", 2.4, "quad", "A farm pig: 2.4 ft tall at the back, a fat barrel body about 3.6 ft long. Unmistakably a pig and not a boar: smooth pale pink-cream skin with one big ochre patch, a round flat snout, floppy ears falling forward over its eyes, a fat belly, short thick legs with trotters, a short thick curly tail. No tusks, no bristles.", "one fat farm pig standing on all four legs", ["a pig, without tusks"], length=3.6, srd=["pig"], tags=["swine", "hog", "livestock"])
animal("sheep", "a sheep", 2.8, "quad", "A sheep: 2.8 ft tall, a round woolly body about 3.4 ft long. Unmistakably a sheep: a thick fleece drawn as a few big chunky cream-white curls like a cloud, a narrow dark charcoal face with sideways ears, four thin-looking but sturdy dark legs with hooves showing below the wool, a short thick tail.", "one woolly sheep standing on all four legs", ["a woolly fleece"], length=3.4, srd=["sheep", "goat"], tags=["ewe", "livestock"])
animal("goat", "a goat", 3.2, "quad", "A billy goat: 3.2 ft tall to the tips of its horns, about 3.5 ft long. Unmistakably a goat, not a sheep or deer: two thick ridged horns sweeping back, a long face with a pointed BEARD under the chin, sideways ears, a shaggy ochre-and-cream coat in a few chunky tufts, a short upturned tail, sturdy legs with cloven hooves.", "one bearded goat with horns standing on all four legs", ["horns and a beard"], length=3.5, srd=["goat", "giant goat"], tags=["billy goat", "livestock"])
animal("chicken", "a chicken", 1.6, "odd", "A hen drawn large for the table, 1.6 ft tall: a plump round body of ochre-brown feathers drawn as a few big smooth scallops, a small head with a red comb and wattles and a short cream beak, a short upright fan tail, two thick ochre legs with big toes flat on the ground. Wings folded smooth against the body.", "one plump hen standing on two legs", ["a chicken"], srd=["chicken"], tags=["hen", "rooster", "poultry", "livestock"])
animal("dog", "a guard dog", 2.6, "quad", "A big guard dog, a mastiff type: 2.2 ft at the shoulder, 2.6 ft to the top of its head, about 3.5 ft long. Unmistakably a pet dog and not a wolf: a broad square head with a short blunt black muzzle and heavy jowls, FLOPPY folded ears, a short smooth fawn-tan coat (no long fur), a thick neck with a broad burgundy COLLAR with a brass tag, a short thick tail carried low. Mouth closed.", "one large short-haired dog with floppy ears and a collar standing on all four legs", ["a collar", "floppy ears"], length=3.5, srd=["mastiff"], tags=["dog", "hound", "guard dog"])
animal("dog-small", "a small dog", 1.5, "quad", "A small scruffy terrier drawn large for the table: 1.5 ft to the top of its head, about 1.8 ft long. A wiry cream-and-ochre coat in a few chunky tufts with shaggy eyebrows and a beard, one ear up and one folded, a short thick tail held UP, a burgundy neckerchief. Standing square on four short sturdy legs, mouth closed.", "one small scruffy dog with a neckerchief standing on all four legs", ["a small dog"], length=1.8, srd=["dog", "jackal"], tags=["dog", "terrier", "pet"])
animal("cat", "a cat", 1.4, "quad", "A house cat drawn large for the table: 1.4 ft to the tips of its ears, about 1.8 ft long. A plump ginger tabby with broad darker stripes, a cream chest and paws, big upright triangular ears, big green-yellow eyes, and a THICK tail as thick as its leg held straight UP behind it with a curled tip. Standing on all four short thick legs.", "one cat standing on all four legs with its tail up", QUAD, length=1.8, srd=["cat"], tags=["pet", "familiar"])
animal("raven", "a raven", 1.6, "odd", "A raven drawn large for the table, standing on the ground with its WINGS FOLDED: 1.6 ft tall. A compact glossy charcoal-black bird with dark burgundy sheen in broad highlights (not blue), a big thick slightly curved dark beak, a shaggy throat drawn as a few chunky feathers, a wedge tail touching the ground behind, two thick dark legs with toes flat on the ground.", "one black raven standing on the ground with its wings folded", ["a black bird with a thick beak", "wings folded"], srd=["raven", "swarm of ravens", "crow"], tags=["crow", "bird", "familiar"])
animal("hawk", "a hawk", 2.0, "odd", "A hunting hawk drawn large for the table, standing on the ground with its WINGS FOLDED tight against its body: 2 ft tall. A compact upright bird: a round head with a thick hooked ochre beak and fierce yellow eyes, a cream breast with burgundy-brown bars, chestnut-brown back and folded wings drawn as two solid smooth shapes, a short thick banded tail touching the ground level behind, two very thick ochre legs with big talons flat on the ground.", "one bird of prey standing upright on the ground with its wings folded", ["wings folded against the body"], srd=["hawk", "blood hawk", "eagle"], tags=["falcon", "bird", "familiar"])
animal("owl", "an owl", 1.8, "odd", "An owl drawn large for the table, standing on the ground, 1.8 ft tall: a round, upright, barrel-shaped bird with a big round head, a flat heart-shaped cream face with two huge round ochre eyes and a small hooked beak, two short thick ear tufts, soft brown-and-cream barred feathers drawn as big smooth scallops, wings folded smooth against the body, two thick feathered legs with talons flat on the ground.", "one owl standing upright on the ground", ["a round flat owl face with big eyes"], srd=["owl"], tags=["bird", "familiar"])
animal("stag", "a stag", 6.0, "quad", "A stag: 4 ft tall at the shoulder and 6 ft to the top of its antlers, a compact body about 4.6 ft long. A proud red deer with a thick neck ruff, a warm russet-brown coat with a cream rump and belly, big dark eyes, upright ears, and a pair of antlers drawn VERY THICK and simple: each with only three short blunt tines, close together above the head. Slender-looking but sturdy legs with hooves.", "one stag with thick simple antlers standing on all four legs", ["antlers"], length=4.6, srd=["deer", "elk", "giant elk"], tags=["deer", "elk", "hart"])
animal("fox", "a fox", 1.8, "quad", "A red fox drawn large for the table: 1.8 ft to the tips of its ears, about 2.2 ft long plus its tail. Unmistakably a fox and not a dog or wolf: a narrow pointed muzzle, big upright black-tipped ears, a bright russet-orange coat, a cream chest and muzzle, black legs like stockings, and a huge, thick, bushy tail with a cream tip carried low and curved close round its side.", "one fox with a big bushy tail standing on all four legs", QUAD, length=2.6, srd=["fox", "jackal"], tags=["familiar", "animal"])
animal("toad", "a toad", 1.2, "odd", "A fat toad drawn large for the table, 1.2 ft tall and 1.8 ft across, squatting: a wide flat head with a huge closed mouth and two bulging ochre eyes, a lumpy warty brown-ochre body with a cream throat, thick folded hind legs at its sides and two thick front legs planted in front, all four feet flat on the ground.", "one fat warty toad squatting", ["a squatting toad"], srd=["frog", "toad"], tags=["frog", "familiar"])
