beast("foe-stirge", "a stirge", 1.6, "odd", "A stirge drawn large for the table, 1.6 ft tall, standing on the ground: a blood-sucking pest like a cross between a bat and a mosquito: a fat rust-red furry body, a long THICK needle-like pale proboscis as thick as a thumb pointing forward and down, two big round ochre eyes, four small clawed legs flat on the ground, and two pairs of small leathery WINGS FOLDED against its back as thick solid shapes.", "one small bat-mosquito creature with a long thick proboscis, wings folded", ["a long proboscis"], srd=["stirge"], tags=["bloodsucker", "pest"], prio=3.5)
beast("foe-giant-beetle", "a giant fire beetle", 1.6, "odd", "A giant beetle 1.6 ft tall and 3 ft long: a domed glossy burgundy-black shell in two wing-case halves, a broad head with two thick curved pincer jaws, six very thick short legs flat on the ground, and two round glands glowing warm orange (painted solid, not glowing) above its eyes.", "one big domed beetle with pincer jaws and six thick legs", ["a domed shell and six legs"], srd=["giant fire beetle", "swarm of insects"], tags=["beetle", "insect", "vermin"], **C)
beast("foe-giant-scorpion", "a giant scorpion", 3.2, "odd", "A giant scorpion, 3.2 ft tall to the top of its raised tail, fitting a 4.5-ft circle: a flat armoured ochre-brown body, two very thick short arms ending in big blunt pincers held close in front, eight very thick short legs flat on the ground, and a thick segmented tail arched up and forward over its back ending in a big dark bulb sting.", "one giant scorpion with two pincers and a sting arched over its back", ["two pincers", "a tail with a sting arched over the back"], srd=["giant scorpion", "scorpion"], tags=["insect", "vermin", "desert"], **C)
beast("foe-giant-wasp", "a giant wasp", 2.4, "odd", "A giant wasp drawn standing on the ground, 2.4 ft tall and 3.5 ft long: a body in three fat segments with bold ochre-yellow and charcoal bands, a big head with huge dark eyes and thick jaws, six very thick legs flat on the ground, a fat striped abdomen curled under ending in a thick dark sting, and two pairs of WINGS FOLDED flat along its back, drawn as two thick solid pale cream shapes (opaque).", "one giant striped wasp standing with its wings folded", ["a striped body", "a sting"], srd=["giant wasp", "swarm of insects"], tags=["insect", "bee", "hornet"], **C)
beast("foe-rust-monster", "a rust monster", 3.0, "quad", "A rust monster, 3 ft tall and about 4.5 ft long: a hunched, armadillo-like insect-beast with a segmented rust-orange armoured back, a small beaked head with two LONG THICK feathery antennae curving forward (each as thick as a wrist, drawn as solid ochre fronds), four thick legs with clawed feet flat on the ground, and a thick tail ending in a flat paddle with two prongs, curled close beside it.", "one armoured rust-coloured beast on legs with two thick antennae", ["two long antennae"], length=4.5, srd=["rust monster"], tags=["dungeon"], prio=3.5)
beast("foe-ettercap", "an ettercap", 6.0, "hum", "An ettercap, 6 ft tall: a hunched spider-man with a bloated purple-grey body and pot belly, a spider-like head with a cluster of dark eyes and two thick fangs, long thick arms ending in two big hooked claws each held close in front of its chest, short bowed legs with clawed feet. Thick cream strands of web hang in short ropes from its wrists.", "one hunched spider-headed humanoid with a pot belly and big hooked claws", ["a spider-like head"], srd=["ettercap"], tags=["spider", "forest"], **C)
beast("foe-ankheg", "an ankheg", 5.0, "odd", "An ankheg, 5 ft tall, fitting an 8.5-ft circle: a huge burrowing insect rearing up out of a low mound of dark broken earth flat on the ground: a segmented ochre-brown armoured body rising in an S, a head with big black eyes, two thick antennae and two huge curved pincer jaws, six very thick clawed legs spread close beside its body.", "one huge burrowing insect with pincer jaws rearing out of a mound of earth", ["pincer jaws", "an armoured segmented body"], base=10, group="large", srd=["ankheg", "bulette"], tags=["insect", "burrower"], **C)
beast("foe-grick", "a grick", 3.5, "odd", "A grick, 3.5 ft tall: a thick, rubbery, grey-ochre worm-snake as thick as a man's waist, coiled once on the ground with its front half reared up; its head is a hard dark hooked BEAK surrounded by FOUR very thick short tentacles spread like a flower. Its coiled body is flat on the ground.", "one thick worm-like creature with a beak ringed by four thick tentacles, reared up from a coil", ["a beak with tentacles round it"], srd=["grick"], tags=["worm", "cave"], **C)
beast("foe-gibbering-mouther", "a gibbering mouther", 3.5, "odd", "A gibbering mouther, 3.5 ft tall and 4 ft across: a heaving mound of pale pink-grey flesh covered all over with many big staring ochre EYES and many wide open MOUTHS with thick cream teeth, a few thick blunt lumps reaching up. One solid mass with its underside flat on the ground.", "one mound of flesh covered in many eyes and mouths", ["many eyes and mouths on one blob"], srd=["gibbering mouther"], tags=["aberration", "blob"], **C)
beast("foe-darkmantle", "a darkmantle", 2.5, "odd", "A darkmantle drawn for the table, 2.5 ft tall: a cave creature like a small squid standing on its tentacles: a smooth pointed stone-grey cone body like a stalactite, two small pale eyes near its base, and eight very thick short tentacles joined by a web of thick skin, spread on the ground beneath it like a skirt.", "one cone-shaped stone-coloured squid-like creature standing on a skirt of webbed tentacles", ["a cone body on webbed tentacles"], srd=["darkmantle", "piercer", "cloaker"], tags=["cave", "squid"], **C)
beast("foe-fungus", "a violet fungus", 5.0, "odd", "A violet fungus, 5 ft tall: a monstrous mushroom with a thick pale cream stalk, a wide dark burgundy-purple cap with big ochre spots, and FOUR very thick short branch-arms sprouting from the stalk, each ending in a blunt purple club, held close. A ring of small fat cream mushrooms round its base, flat on the ground.", "one giant mushroom with a spotted cap and four thick arm-like branches", ["a mushroom cap", "arm-like branches"], srd=["violet fungus", "shrieker", "myconid"], tags=["mushroom", "plant", "cave"], **C)
beast("foe-mephit", "a mephit", 3.5, "hum", "A mephit, 3.5 ft tall: a small, wiry, impish elemental sprite with a long pointed nose and chin, big pointed ears, a wicked grin, thin limbs with clawed hands and feet, two small bat WINGS FOLDED against its back as thick solid shapes, a thin thick-ended tail curled by its feet. Its whole body is cracked dark grey-brown stone with veins of warm orange (painted solid, not glowing), and a crest of solid flame-shaped orange hair.", "one small impish winged stone-skinned creature with a long nose and a flame-like crest", ["small folded wings", "a long nose"], srd=["magma mephit", "steam mephit", "dust mephit", "ice mephit", "magmin"], tags=["elemental", "imp"], **C)
beast("foe-merfolk", "a merfolk", 5.5, "odd", "A merfolk warrior for water scenes, 5.5 ft tall: the upper body of a sea-green-skinned man with long dark hair as one solid tail and fin-like ears, rising upright from a thick scaly fish TAIL of moss green and cream that coils once on a low ring of chunky solid cream foam flat on the ground, the broad tail fin lying flat. His RIGHT hand holds a TRIDENT upright close at his side, butt at ground level: a THICK bone-white shaft with three very thick short blunt prongs.", "one merman: a man's upper body on a coiled fish tail that rests on a ring of foam (the water; the foam is wanted and is not a base), holding one thick trident upright", ["a fish tail instead of legs", "a ring of foam or water under the tail", "exactly one trident, complete end to end"], shaft="trident", srd=["merfolk", "merrow", "sea hag"], tags=["mermaid", "sea", "water"], **C)
beast("foe-sahuagin", "a sahuagin", 6.0, "hum", "A sahuagin, 6 ft tall: a fish-man sea raider with moss-green scales and a cream belly, a wide shark-like mouth of thick teeth, big round black eyes, a tall webbed fin crest down its head and back drawn as one thick solid shape, webbed clawed hands and feet, a thick finned tail hanging close behind. Its RIGHT hand holds a SPEAR upright close at its side, butt at ground level: a THICK bone-white shaft with a BIG broad pale coral-pink barbed blade above its head.", "one finned green fish-man holding one spear upright", ["a fish-like head and fins", "exactly one spear, complete end to end"], shaft="spear", srd=["sahuagin", "kuo-toa stand-in"], tags=["fish-man", "sea devil", "sea"], **C)
beast("foe-dark-elf", "a dark elf warrior", 5.6, "hum", "A dark elf warrior of the underworld, 5.6 ft tall: slim, with charcoal-grey skin, long white hair in one thick solid tail, long pointed ears and pale eyes. Close-fitting black leather and dark mail with burgundy trim, a short dark cloak lying flat on the back. The RIGHT hand holds a slim but BROAD-bladed bright SHORT SWORD upright in front of the shoulder; the LEFT hand holds a small pale hand CROSSBOW (a short thick stock) against the chest.", "one grey-skinned white-haired elf in dark armour holding one short sword upright and one small crossbow", ["exactly one short sword", "dark grey skin and white hair"], srd=["drow"], tags=["drow", "underdark", "elf"], **C)
beast("foe-grey-dwarf", "a grey dwarf", 4.2, "hum", "A grey dwarf of the deep, 4.2 ft tall and very broad: ash-grey skin, a bald head, a long white beard as one solid chunky shape, a grim scowl. Heavy dark iron scale armour with ochre straps. The RIGHT hand holds a WAR PICK upright beside the shoulder, a thick pale shaft with a big bright steel pick head; the LEFT arm holds a round dark iron shield with a brass boss close in front of the left side.", "one grey-skinned bald white-bearded dwarf in dark armour holding one war pick upright and one round shield", ["exactly one war pick", "grey skin"], srd=["duergar", "deep gnome (svirfneblin)", "azer"], tags=["duergar", "underdark", "dwarf"], **C)
beast("foe-grimlock", "a grimlock", 5.6, "hum", "A grimlock, 5.6 ft tall: a hunched, muscular, hairless cave-dweller with thick grey skin, NO EYES (smooth skin where eyes would be), wide nostrils, big ears, a wide mouth of thick teeth. A ragged hide loincloth and bone necklace. Its RIGHT hand holds a heavy pale bone-white CLUB set with big dark stone spikes upright beside its shoulder; its left hand is a fist near its hip.", "one hunched grey hairless cave-dweller (blank, sunken or no eyes) holding one spiked bone club upright", ["exactly one club"], srd=["grimlock", "tribal warrior"], tags=["caveman", "underdark", "morlock"], **C)
beast("foe-wisp", "a will-o'-wisp", 3.0, "odd", "A will-o'-wisp for the table, 3 ft tall: a ball of ghost-light the size of a head, drawn as ONE solid, opaque, pale cream-yellow flame-shaped orb with a darker ochre core like a tiny skull face, sitting on top of a thick wavering column of pale mist that widens to a small ring flat on the ground. Solid like carved wax; not transparent, not glowing.", "one pale flame-shaped orb on a column of mist", ["an orb of light on a stem"], srd=["will-o'-wisp"], tags=["ghost light", "swamp", "spirit"], **C)
beast("foe-flying-sword", "a flying sword", 4.5, "odd", "An animated flying sword for the table, 4.5 ft tall: a broad bright steel longsword with a brass crossguard and a burgundy-wrapped grip, hanging point-DOWN in the air, its point resting on the tip of a thick swirling column of pale cream mist that widens to a small ring flat on the ground. The blade is as broad as a hand.", "one broad sword standing point-down on a small swirl of mist", ["a sword with nobody holding it"], srd=["flying sword", "rug of smothering"], tags=["animated object", "construct"], **C)
beast("foe-homunculus", "a homunculus", 1.8, "hum", "A homunculus drawn large for the table, 1.8 ft tall: a tiny, ugly, bald artificial man with grey-pink clay-like skin, a big head, pointed ears, a sharp-toothed grin, a pot belly, thin arms and legs, and two small bat WINGS FOLDED against its back as thick solid shapes. It stands on two clawed feet holding a big brass KEY against its chest with both hands.", "one tiny bald winged clay-skinned man holding a big key", ["small folded wings"], srd=["homunculus", "quasit"], tags=["familiar", "construct", "wizard's servant"], **C)
beast("foe-pixie", "a pixie", 1.8, "hum", "A pixie drawn large for the table, 1.8 ft tall: a tiny, slender fairy with pointed ears and a mischievous face, auburn hair in one solid tuft, a tunic of big moss-green leaves, bare feet, and two pairs of butterfly WINGS held together upright behind its back as ONE thick solid cream-and-ochre shape (opaque, not spread wide). Its RIGHT hand holds a short thick pale thorn like a sword, upright; left hand on hip.", "one tiny winged fairy in a leaf tunic holding one thorn like a sword", ["wings behind the back"], srd=["sprite", "pixie"], tags=["fairy", "fey", "sprite"], **C)
beast("foe-death-dog", "a death dog", 3.6, "quad", "A death dog, 3.6 ft tall and about 4.5 ft long: an ugly, mangy hound with TWO heads side by side on thick necks, each with a blunt snarling muzzle, thick fangs and small torn ears; a gaunt ochre-grey body with dark blotches and showing ribs, thick legs, a thin tail carried low.", "one gaunt hound with two heads standing on all four legs", ["TWO heads"], length=4.5, srd=["death dog", "blink dog", "hyena", "giant hyena"], tags=["two-headed dog", "hound", "hyena"], **C)
beast("beast-lion", "a lion", 4.2, "quad", "A male lion: 3.6 ft at the shoulder, 4.2 ft to the top of its head, a compact body about 4.6 ft long. Unmistakably a lion: a big dark ochre-brown MANE drawn as one thick chunky mass round the head and chest, a broad muzzle with a closed mouth, round ears, a tawny golden coat, thick legs with big paws, and a thick tail with a dark tuft curled close along its flank.", "one maned lion standing on all four legs", QUAD + ["a mane"], group="beast", length=4.6, srd=["lion"], tags=["big cat"], **C)
beast("beast-tiger", "a tiger", 3.8, "quad", "A tiger: 3.2 ft at the shoulder, 3.8 ft to the top of its head, a compact body about 4.6 ft long. Unmistakably a tiger: a rich orange coat with BROAD black stripes, a cream belly, chest and cheeks, a round striped head with small round ears and a closed mouth, thick legs with big paws, and a thick striped tail curled close along its flank.", "one striped tiger standing on all four legs", QUAD + ["stripes"], group="beast", length=4.6, srd=["tiger", "panther", "saber-toothed tiger"], tags=["big cat", "panther", "leopard"], **C)
beast("beast-ape", "an ape", 4.5, "quad", "A big ape, a gorilla, knuckle-walking on all fours: 4.5 ft tall at its massive shoulders, about 4 ft long. A domed head with a heavy brow and a bare dark leathery face, huge shoulders and very long thick arms planted on its knuckles, short bowed legs, charcoal-black fur in a few big chunky tufts with a silver-grey saddle on its back. No tail.", "one gorilla standing on its knuckles and feet", ["a gorilla"], group="beast", length=4.0, srd=["ape", "baboon", "giant ape"], tags=["gorilla", "monkey"], **C)
beast("beast-axe-beak", "an axe beak", 6.5, "odd", "An axe beak, 6.5 ft tall: a huge flightless bird like a heavy ostrich with a short thick neck and an enormous, deep, AXE-shaped ochre beak; small folded wings drawn as smooth solid shapes against its round body of grey-brown feathers in big scallops, a short fan tail, and two very thick long scaly legs with big three-toed feet flat on the ground.", "one huge flightless bird with an enormous axe-shaped beak on two thick legs", ["a huge beak", "two thick legs"], group="beast", srd=["axe beak"], tags=["bird", "mount", "terror bird"], **C)
beast("beast-camel", "a camel", 7.0, "quad", "A camel with NO rider: 6 ft at its single HUMP and 7 ft to the top of its head, a body about 7.5 ft long. Unmistakably a camel: one big rounded hump, a long curved neck, a droopy-lipped haughty face, a sandy ochre shaggy coat, long thick legs with broad padded feet, a thin tail hanging close. A burgundy and cream striped blanket and a pale wooden pack frame with two fat cream bundles strapped tight over the hump.", "one camel with a hump carrying a pack, no rider, standing on all four legs", ["a hump", "no rider"], base=10, group="beast", length=7.5, srd=["camel"], tags=["mount", "desert", "pack animal"], **C)
beast("beast-elephant", "an elephant", 10.0, "quad", "An elephant: 9 ft at the shoulder and 10 ft to the top of its head, a body compact enough to fit an 8.5-ft circle with its trunk curled. A huge grey-ochre wrinkled body, big fan ears held flat against its shoulders, two thick short cream TUSKS, a very thick trunk curled inward in front of its chest, four pillar legs with flat round feet, a thin tail hanging close.", "one elephant with tusks and a curled trunk standing on all four legs", ["a trunk and tusks"], base=10, group="beast", length=8.5, srd=["elephant", "mammoth"], tags=["mammoth", "mount"], **C)
beast("beast-rhinoceros", "a rhinoceros", 5.5, "quad", "A rhinoceros: 5.5 ft at the shoulder, a barrel body about 8 ft long. A massive grey-brown armour-plated hide in big folded slabs, a long heavy head carried low with ONE very thick cream horn on the nose and a smaller one behind it, small ears, four short pillar legs with three-toed feet, a short thick tail.", "one rhinoceros with a horn on its nose standing on all four legs", ["a horn on the nose"], base=10, group="beast", length=8.0, srd=["rhinoceros", "triceratops", "gorgon"], tags=["rhino"], **C)
beast("foe-giant-crab", "a giant crab", 2.5, "odd", "A giant crab, 2.5 ft tall and 4.2 ft across: a wide, flat, burgundy-orange shell with a cream underside, two eyes on short thick stalks, two very thick arms with big blunt pincers held up close in front, and eight very thick short legs flat on the ground.", "one giant crab with two big pincers", ["two pincers and a wide shell"], srd=["giant crab", "crab", "chuul"], tags=["crab", "sea", "beach"], **C)
beast("foe-shark", "a shark", 3.5, "odd", "A shark for water scenes, shown breaking the surface: a thick grey-GREEN shark's head and back, 5 ft long, rising at a slant out of a low ring of chunky solid cream foam flat on the ground (the water), its tall triangular dorsal FIN the highest point at 3.5 ft, its mouth open showing rows of thick cream teeth, a pale cream belly, small black eyes. Only the front half shows.", "the front half of one shark, head and back fin, breaking out of a ring of foam (the water; the foam is wanted and is not a base, and only the front half is meant to show)", ["a shark with a dorsal fin", "the shark rising from a ring of foam or water"], srd=["reef shark", "hunter shark", "giant shark", "killer whale", "quipper", "swarm of quippers"], tags=["sea", "water", "fish"], **C)
beast("foe-medusa", "a medusa", 5.8, "robe", "A medusa, 5.8 ft tall: a woman with pale grey-green scaly skin, cold staring eyes, and instead of hair a nest of about NINE very thick short moss-green SNAKES rising from her head, each as thick as a wrist with a blunt head. A long ochre and cream draped gown ending at the ankles with a brass snake belt. Her LEFT hand holds a thick pale BOW (one solid chunky curved limb, no string) upright close at her side, lower tip at ground level; her right hand is raised, clawed, close beside her face.", "one woman with thick snakes for hair in a long gown holding one thick bow upright", ["snakes for hair"], shaft="bow", top=6.3, srd=["medusa"], tags=["gorgon", "petrify", "snake hair", "boss"], boss=True, **C)
beast("foe-lamia", "a lamia", 6.5, "quad", "A lamia, 6.5 ft tall to the top of her head: the upper body of a beautiful, cruel woman with dark hair in one thick solid braid and brass jewellery, rising where the neck would be from the four-legged body of a tawny LION with big paws and a tufted tail curled close along the flank. Her RIGHT hand holds a broad bright curved DAGGER upright beside her shoulder; her left hand is raised, palm up, close.", "one lion's four-legged body with a woman's upper body, holding one curved dagger", ["a lion body with a human torso"], base=10, group="large", length=6.5, top=6.5, srd=["lamia", "gynosphinx", "androsphinx"], tags=["lion-woman", "sphinx", "desert"], boss=True, **C)
beast("foe-couatl", "a couatl", 5.0, "odd", "A couatl, 5 ft tall, coiled: a great feathered serpent as thick as a man's thigh, its body in two stacked coils flat on the ground with the neck and head rising from the middle; scales of warm gold-ochre and cream with a moss-green back; a noble snake head with a crest of big rainbow-warm feathers (burgundy, ochre, green; no blue) drawn as a few thick solid plumes; two feathered WINGS FOLDED tight against its body as thick solid shapes (not spread).", "one coiled feathered serpent with folded wings and a crest of plumes", ["a snake body with feathered wings, folded"], srd=["couatl", "guardian naga", "spirit naga"], tags=["feathered serpent", "celestial", "naga"], **C)
beast("foe-naga", "a naga", 6.0, "odd", "A naga, 6 ft tall, coiled: a giant serpent as thick as a barrel in three stacked coils flat on the ground with its neck rising from the middle, and at the top a HUMAN-like face: bald, stern, with slit eyes, a flared hood of scales like a cobra's behind the head drawn as one thick solid shape, and a brass circlet. Moss-green and ochre banded scales, cream belly.", "one giant coiled serpent with a human-like face and a cobra hood", ["a human-like face on a serpent"], base=10, group="large", srd=["guardian naga", "spirit naga"], tags=["serpent", "snake", "temple guardian"], boss=True, **C)
beast("foe-bulette", "a bulette", 5.5, "quad", "A bulette, a land shark: 5.5 ft tall at the back, a heavy body about 8 ft long. A bullet-shaped armoured head with a huge shark-like mouth of thick teeth, small eyes, thick grey-ochre armour plates over the back with one tall plate standing up like a FIN behind the shoulders, four short, enormously thick legs with big digging claws flat on the ground, a short thick tail.", "one armoured four-legged beast with a shark-like mouth and a fin-like plate on its back", ["a fin-like plate on the back", "a huge toothed mouth"], base=10, group="large", length=8.0, srd=["bulette", "ankheg"], tags=["land shark", "burrower"], **C)
beast("foe-iron-bull", "an iron bull", 6.0, "quad", "A gorgon in the old bestiary sense: a monstrous BULL covered in dark iron-grey metal scales like plate armour, 6 ft at the shoulder, about 8 ft long, with two thick forward-curving horns, glowing ochre eyes (solid), and thick curls of pale green-grey vapour drawn as solid chunky puffs at its nostrils. Massive shoulders, thick legs with big hooves, a thick scaled tail with a tuft.", "one huge bull covered in metal scales with puffs of vapour at its nostrils", ["a bull covered in metal plates or scales"], base=10, group="large", length=8.0, srd=["gorgon"], tags=["bull", "petrify"], **C)
beast("foe-otyugh", "an otyugh", 5.5, "odd", "An otyugh, 5.5 ft tall, fitting an 8.5-ft circle: a bloated, warty, dung-brown blob of a body on three very thick stumpy legs, with a huge wide mouth of thick crooked teeth across its front, and THREE very thick tentacles rising from its back: two ending in broad leaf-shaped pads covered in blunt spikes, held curled close, and one shorter stalk in the middle carrying three ochre eyes.", "one bloated three-legged creature with a huge mouth, two spiked tentacles and an eye stalk", ["a huge mouth", "tentacles"], base=10, group="large", srd=["otyugh"], tags=["sewer", "garbage eater"], **C)
beast("foe-roper", "a roper", 8.0, "odd", "A roper, 8 ft tall: a monster that looks like a thick stalagmite of grey-ochre rock, as wide as a barrel at the base and tapering to a blunt point, with ONE big yellow eye in the middle, a wide jagged mouth of thick stone teeth below it, and SIX very thick ropy tentacles growing from its sides, each curled close against its body. Its base is flat on the ground.", "one stalagmite-like rock creature with a single eye, a toothed mouth and thick tentacles curled close", ["one eye and a mouth on a rock pillar"], base=10, group="large", srd=["roper", "piercer"], tags=["cave", "stalagmite"], **C)
beast("foe-salamander", "a salamander", 7.0, "odd", "A fire salamander, 7 ft tall: the upper body of a muscular man-shaped creature with dark burgundy-red scaled skin, a crest of solid flame-shaped orange spines down its head and back, glowing ochre eyes (solid), rising from a very thick serpent body of red and orange scales coiled once on the ground. Its RIGHT hand holds a SPEAR upright close at its side, butt at ground level: a THICK dark iron shaft with a BIG broad bright orange-hot blade (painted solid) above its head.", "one red serpent-bodied man-shaped creature with a flame crest holding one spear upright", ["a serpent lower body", "exactly one spear, complete end to end"], shaft="spear", base=10, group="large", srd=["salamander", "azer", "magmin"], tags=["fire", "elemental"], **C)
beast("foe-unicorn", "a unicorn", 6.6, "quad", "A unicorn: a graceful white horse 5 ft at the withers and 6.6 ft to the tip of its HORN, about 7 ft long. A cream-white coat, a thick pale gold mane and tail drawn as solid chunky shapes (the tail hanging straight down close behind), a short tufted beard, cloven hooves, and ONE straight, very thick, spiral pale-gold horn on its forehead, as long as its head.", "one white horse with a single thick horn on its forehead standing on all four legs", ["ONE horn on the forehead"], base=10, group="large", length=7.0, srd=["unicorn"], tags=["horse", "fey", "celestial"], **C)
beast("foe-pegasus", "a pegasus", 6.5, "quad", "A pegasus: a white winged horse 5.2 ft at the withers and 6.5 ft to the top of its ears, about 7 ft long, with NO rider. A cream-white coat, a thick pale grey mane and tail drawn as solid chunky shapes, and two great feathered WINGS FOLDED tight along its back and flanks as two thick solid cream shapes (not spread). Thick sturdy legs with hooves.", "one white horse with folded feathered wings standing on all four legs", ["a horse with wings, folded"], base=10, group="large", length=7.0, srd=["pegasus"], tags=["winged horse", "mount"], **C)
beast("foe-triceratops", "a triceratops", 7.0, "quad", "A triceratops: 7 ft tall at the top of its frill, a massive body about 8.5 ft long with its tail curved close. A huge head with a big bony FRILL edged with blunt knobs, two long thick brow horns and a short nose horn, a parrot-like beak; an ochre-brown hide with darker moss-green bands, four pillar legs, a thick tail curved round beside its flank.", "one three-horned dinosaur with a big bony neck frill standing on all four legs", ["three horns and a neck frill"], base=10, group="large", length=8.5, srd=["triceratops"], tags=["dinosaur"], **C)
beast("foe-tyrannosaur", "a tyrannosaur", 12.0, "odd", "A tyrannosaurus, 12 ft tall, standing fairly upright so that it fits inside an 8.5-ft-wide cylinder: a huge two-legged predator with an enormous head with a closed jaw lined with thick cream teeth showing, tiny two-clawed arms held against its chest, a deep body, two massive bird-like legs with big clawed feet flat on the ground, and a thick tail curved round close beside its legs to the ground. Moss-green hide with ochre-brown bands and a cream belly.", "one huge two-legged dinosaur with a giant head and tiny arms", ["a huge head and tiny arms on two legs"], base=10, group="large", srd=["tyrannosaurus rex", "allosaurus"], tags=["dinosaur", "t-rex", "boss"], boss=True, **C)
beast("foe-drider", "a drider", 7.5, "odd", "A drider, 7.5 ft tall, fitting an 8.5-ft circle: the upper body of a dark elf (charcoal-grey skin, long white hair in one solid tail, pointed ears, dark mail) rising from the front of the bloated black body of a GIANT SPIDER with a burgundy hourglass mark and EIGHT very thick, strongly arched legs with all feet flat on the ground, tucked close. The RIGHT hand holds a broad bright SWORD upright in front of the shoulder; the left hand holds a thick pale bow (one solid curved limb) upright at the side.", "one dark elf's upper body on a giant spider's body with eight thick legs, holding one sword upright", ["a spider body with a humanoid torso"], base=10, group="large", srd=["drider"], tags=["spider", "drow", "underdark"], boss=True, **C)
beast("foe-genie-djinni", "a djinni", 9.0, "odd", "A djinni, 9 ft tall: a huge, muscular, bare-chested genie with pale cream-grey skin, a bald head with one thick black topknot, a curled moustache and pointed beard, arms folded across his chest, broad brass arm bands and a burgundy sash; below the waist his body becomes a thick spiralling column of pale cloud that narrows to a small ring flat on the ground (no legs). Solid and opaque; not transparent, not glowing.", "one huge bare-chested genie with folded arms whose lower body is a column of cloud", ["a lower body of cloud or smoke, no legs", "arms folded"], base=10, group="large", srd=["djinni", "invisible stalker"], tags=["genie", "air", "wish"], boss=True, **C)
beast("foe-genie-efreeti", "an efreeti", 10.0, "hum", "An efreeti, 10 ft tall: a huge, muscular, bare-chested fire genie with brick-red skin, two short thick horns, pointed ears, tusk-like fangs, a black pointed beard, and hair of solid flame-shaped orange tongues. Brass armour plates on the shoulders and forearms, a burgundy and ochre kilt, brass-shod feet. His RIGHT hand holds a huge broad curved SCIMITAR with a bright blade upright in front of his shoulder; his left fist is on his hip. Everything inside an 8.5-ft-wide cylinder.", "one huge red horned fire genie with flame hair holding one big curved sword upright", ["red skin and flame hair", "exactly one big curved sword"], base=10, group="large", srd=["efreeti", "fire giant", "oni"], tags=["genie", "fire"], boss=True, **C)
beast("foe-devil", "a horned devil", 8.0, "hum", "A horned devil, 8 ft tall: a tall, lean, scaly dark burgundy-red fiend with a long cruel face, two long thick horns curving up and back, pointed ears, a thick tail with a barbed tip curled close by its feet, and two bat WINGS FOLDED SHUT and wrapped close round its shoulders and back like a short cloak (two thick solid dark shapes hanging down behind the arms, closed like a furled umbrella, NOT spread, NOT raised, no thin membranes, nothing wider than its shoulders). Its RIGHT hand holds a FORK upright close at its side, butt at ground level: a THICK dark iron shaft with two very thick short blunt bright prongs above its head.", "one tall red horned winged devil, wings folded, holding one fork or trident upright", ["horns", "wings folded, not spread", "one fork or trident, complete end to end"], shaft="fork", base=10, group="large", srd=["horned devil", "bearded devil", "barbed devil", "bone devil", "chain devil", "erinyes"], tags=["fiend", "devil", "pitchfork", "boss"], boss=True, **C)
beast("foe-vulture-demon", "a vulture demon", 8.0, "hum", "A vulture demon, 8 ft tall: a gaunt fiend with the head of a huge VULTURE (a bald wrinkled burgundy head, a thick hooked ochre beak, a ruff of cream feathers at the neck), a hunched feathered grey-brown body, long thick arms with big talons held close in front of its chest, bird legs with big clawed feet, and two great feathered WINGS FOLDED tight behind it as two thick solid shapes (not spread).", "one hunched vulture-headed feathered demon with folded wings and big talons", ["a vulture's head", "wings folded, not spread"], base=10, group="large", srd=["vrock", "glabrezu", "nalfeshnee"], tags=["fiend", "demon"], boss=True, **C)
beast("foe-angel", "an angel", 8.0, "robe", "An angel, 8 ft tall: a tall, serene, beautiful winged being with warm bronze skin, short pale gold hair, and a calm stern face, in a long cream robe with brass shoulder plates and a broad brass belt, ending at the ankles, bare feet. Two great feathered WINGS FOLDED behind as two thick solid cream shapes rising above the shoulders and reaching the ankles (not spread). BOTH hands rest on the pommel of a broad bright GREATSWORD standing point-down at ground level in front of the body.", "one tall winged being in a cream robe, wings folded, both hands on one big sword standing point-down", ["feathered wings, folded", "one sword standing point-down"], shaft="sword", base=10, group="large", srd=["deva", "planetar", "solar"], tags=["celestial", "deva"], boss=True, **C)
beast("foe-frost-giant", "a frost giant", 20.0, "hum", "A frost giant, 20 ft tall: a towering, powerfully built giant with pale grey-WHITE skin (white, not blue), a huge white beard and hair in thick solid braids, a horned iron helmet with two thick short horns, a mantle of shaggy cream-white fur lying flat on the shoulders, a mail shirt and fur kilt, fur boots. BOTH hands hold a huge GREAT AXE upright in front of him, butt at ground level between his feet, one big bright crescent blade beside his head. Everything inside an 8.5-ft-wide cylinder.", "one towering white-bearded giant in furs and a horned helmet holding one huge axe upright in front of him", ["a horned helmet and a white beard", "exactly one huge axe, complete end to end"], shaft="axe", base=10, group="large", srd=["frost giant", "cloud giant", "storm giant", "stone giant"], tags=["giant", "jotun", "boss"], boss=True, **C)
beast("foe-fire-giant", "a fire giant", 18.0, "hum", "A fire giant, 18 ft tall: a towering, broad, dwarf-proportioned giant with coal-black skin, a bushy beard and hair of solid flame-shaped orange tongues, glowing ochre eyes (solid), in heavy dark iron plate armour with brass rivets. BOTH hands rest on the pommel of a huge broad GREATSWORD standing point-down at ground level in front of him, its blade painted orange-hot (solid). Everything inside an 8.5-ft-wide cylinder.", "one towering black-skinned giant with a flame beard in dark plate armour, both hands on one huge sword standing point-down", ["black skin and a flame-like beard", "one huge sword standing point-down"], shaft="sword", base=10, group="large", srd=["fire giant"], tags=["giant", "boss"], boss=True, **C)
beast("foe-doppelganger", "a doppelganger", 5.8, "hum", "A doppelganger in its true form, 5.8 ft tall: a tall, thin, sexless humanoid with smooth pale grey skin like wet clay, a hairless oval head with NO nose and NO ears, only two big blank pale ochre eyes and a thin slit mouth, long thin arms with long thick fingers held a little in front, in a plain close-fitting dark burgundy tunic and trousers, bare feet.", "one thin grey hairless humanoid with a blank face (big eyes, no nose or ears)", ["a blank, featureless face"], srd=["doppelganger"], tags=["shapechanger", "impostor"], **C)
